{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the swarm. Every tile, every tower, every move counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthguard is a tactical tower defense game that rewards clever pathing, smart placement, and flexible strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build mazes, manage your resources, and defend against endless waves of enemies on a battlefield made of tiles. The map tiles can be different every time you play, so you\u2019ll need to adapt your tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place units and towers to build your defense, each with a unique role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged towers</strong> \u2013 Static units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> \u2013 Damage or slow enemies passing through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support towers</strong> \u2013 Generate extra gold over time and boost the stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Units</strong> \u2013 Melee and ranged units that defend your castle and attack the enemy nexus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your towers can become stronger or weaker depending on where you place them. Tiles and nearby towers give different bonuses and penalties, so careful positioning is key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, you choose a hero. Each hero gives different bonuses that can change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planning the perfect maze, creating strong tower combinations, or reacting to surprise enemy attacks, <strong>Hearthguard</strong> is all about using your brain to stay one step ahead.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713520?t=1773830559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713520?t=1773830559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/2c00e3f7a6789d634de149545a286cc2ae3bbe0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773830559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/2c00e3f7a6789d634de149545a286cc2ae3bbe0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773830559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4351220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the swarm. Every tile, every tower, every move counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthguard is a tactical tower defense game that rewards clever pathing, smart placement, and flexible strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build mazes, manage your resources, and defend against endless waves of enemies on a battlefield made of tiles. The map tiles can be different every time you play, so you\u2019ll need to adapt your tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place units and towers to build your defense, each with a unique role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged towers</strong> \u2013 Static units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> \u2013 Damage or slow enemies passing through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support towers</strong> \u2013 Generate extra gold over time and boost the stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Units</strong> \u2013 Melee and ranged units that defend your castle and attack the enemy nexus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your towers can become stronger or weaker depending on where you place them. Tiles and nearby towers give different bonuses and penalties, so careful positioning is key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, you choose a hero. Each hero gives different bonuses that can change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planning the perfect maze, creating strong tower combinations, or reacting to surprise enemy attacks, <strong>Hearthguard</strong> is all about using your brain to stay one step ahead.</p>","developers":[" Sleepy Creepy Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/a57d4920ce3500c7ec507e2f8afecc7ae3788b3b/header.jpg?t=1773830559","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/148461813/b8401faf3694347a2dd4904c95383d7977bd05f6/1772285579/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772288261","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/148461813/b8401faf3694347a2dd4904c95383d7977bd05f6/1772285579/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772288261","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/148461813/b8401faf3694347a2dd4904c95383d7977bd05f6/1772285579/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772288261","id":257295922,"name":"DemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257295922/f519cb65c65f2a2efb6af55c7e48ffdb327b6820/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772288261"}],"name":"Hearthguard","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str